# Source: synthetic (VCF-to-BED conversion error pattern)
# Symptom: SNP positions encoded with 1-based start AND 1-based-closed end (e.g.
# position 100 stored as start=100, end=100 in 1-based-closed convention).
# Structurally invalid coordinate handling is invisible to a single-file validator,
# but the float score ('.') triggers rejection under --spec hts; ucsc passes.
chr1	100	100	rs123	.	+
chr1	500	500	rs456	.	-
chr22	1000000	1000000	rs789	.	+
